        <div class="paragraph__card paragraph paragraph--type--card-basic card_no-border paragraph--view-mode--default">
            <div class="paragraph__column">
                <div class="paragraph__title title_color   ">
                    <h3 class="mt-0 mb-0">
                        
                    </h3>
                </div>
                
            <div class="field field--name-field-card-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div data-langcode="en" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="782958b0-d4fd-4d11-bdf8-6f3c79e364fa" data-embed-button="document_media_browser" data-entity-embed-display="entity_reference:media_thumbnail" data-entity-embed-display-settings="{&quot;image_style&quot;:&quot;original_size&quot;,&quot;image_link&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" class="embedded-entity">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/cdhs/files/styles/original_size/public/snap_fair_hearings_page_banner_0.png" width="1500" height="500" alt="Two images: 1. A judge gesturing to a woman at a desk. 2. An illustration showing food and the logo of the SNAP program." typeof="foaf:Image" class="img-responsive">


</div>
<h3>About SNAP fair hearings</h3><p>You can request a SNAP fair hearing to appeal decisions made about your eligibility and benefits. SNAP fair hearings are heard in the Colorado Department of Human Services SNAP Hearings Unit. SNAP fair hearing appeals can be filed at your <a href="/contact-your-county" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b95604e2-2e63-4172-a197-44d427030f2d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Contact your county human services department">local county human services office</a>. &nbsp;</p><p><strong>Hearings for SNAP Intentional Program Violations (fraud) are heard by the </strong><a href="https://oac.colorado.gov/"><strong>Office of Administrative Courts</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p></div>
      
                
            </div>
    </div>

    </div></div>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

</div>
      <div>


    


  


<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-columns paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--width--wide">
  <div class="paragraph__column ">
